Package: shieldR
Title: Logistics Chain Simulation under Dynamic Challenges
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller",
    email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A research implementation of a fixed five-leg logistics chain
    with time-varying item specifications, imperfect observations, finite
    transport resources, route-risk learning, and static or adaptive disruptions.
    Supports reproducible allocation-rule comparisons, optional item-condition
    and processing models, and paired disruptions-disabled experiments.
    Includes synthetic teaching scenarios and nonparametric analysis helpers.
    The model and its decision heuristics require application-specific validation.
